+# MOC 2 - Nhom C tren TAP TEST UA-DETRAC (40 video), c25. Cau hinh KHOA truoc khi xem ket qua test
+# (configs/phase2/LOCK_moc2.md, results/phase2/lock/lock_moc2.json).
