+# Theo TIEU CHI DA DANG KY TRUOC (HOTA c25 + CI khong chua 0) thi KHONG truc nao cua Nhom C duoc chon:
+#   C1 (track_buffer): moi muc 0.8-4.0 s deu co CI chua 0 -> giu 1.2 s
+#   C3 (tham so nhieu): moi cau hinh CI chua 0 -> giu mac dinh
+#   C2 (vong ghep thu 3 cho track LOST): HOTA CI chua 0 -> KHONG dat tieu chi HOTA
+# Nhung C2 cai thien CO Y NGHIA chi so SU KIEN (giu ID qua che khuat): cv-maha +0.049 [+0.011, +0.080]
+# (preserved, bootstrap theo video). Vi hai chi so khong thong nhat, cac nhanh C2 duoc chay tren test nhu
+# ARM THAM DO (exploratory), ghi ro trong LOCK va bao cao: chung KHONG phai "cau hinh duoc chon theo
+# tieu chi dang ky truoc", va ket qua test cua chung phai doc nhu kiem chung mot gia thuyet, khong phai
+# "cau hinh tot nhat".
